     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I would like to plot a tree with the 95% HPD&#39;s of the node height displayed. From the vignette I see this can be easily done with the following code:<div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#000\">beast</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#000\">annotation</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68);font-family:&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.96px;white-space