     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">please don’t use <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">plot</code> method, which will be removed in next release.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Currently, there is no direct way to scale <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">HPD</code> interval.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj5wbGVhc2UgZG9uJ3QgdXNlIGBwbG90YCBtZXRob2QsIHdoaWNoIHdpbGwgYmUgcmVtb3Zl\r\nZCBpbiBuZXh0IHJlbGVhc2UuPGJyPjxicj48L2Rpdj5DdXJyZW50bHksIHRoZXJlIGlzIG5vIGRp\r\ncmVjdCB3YXkgdG8gc2NhbGUgYEhQRGAgaW50ZXJ2YWwuPGJyPjxicj4=\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
